[r]真珠星攥着暑假作业的习题册，凝望窗外景色。
[np]

[r]西斜的夕阳渐渐低垂，天际线上方已染出些许靛蓝。
[np]

[character name="ryuichi"]
【龙一】[r]「……要不，看会儿夕阳？」
[np]

[supica storage="B3_seifuku_M AB_8_M"]
[playcv storage="supica_supica_00620_008.ogg" name="supica"]
[character name="supica"]
[FACEVIEW storage="supica_AB_8_FACE_seifuku"]
【真珠星】[r]「哎……？」
[np]
[FACEHIDE]

[character name="ryuichi"]
【龙一】[r]「难得来这么早，太阳也快落山了……就当是顺带看看」
[np]

[supica storage="B4_seifuku_M AB_2_M"]
[playcv storage="supica_supica_00620_009.ogg" name="supica"]
[character name="supica"]
[FACEVIEW storage="supica_AB_2_FACE_seifuku"]
